[agent] ### Step 3: Create a Feature Group (`airqfcd91b`)
[agent] I will create a Delta Live Tables (DLT) pipeline to engineer features from the historical data and store them in a feature group. The features will include:
[agent] - Lag features (e.g., `pm25_lag1`, `pm25_lag7`).
[agent] - Rolling statistics (e.g., 7-day rolling mean of `pm25`).
[agent] - Weather features (e.g., `temperature`, `humidity`, `wind_speed`).
[agent] #### Create a DLT Pipeline
[agent] I will create a Python script for the DLT pipeline and upload it to the Databricks workspace.
[agent:write] ?
